        {
          "text": "Yehoiyakimu ŵaliji ni yaka 25 piŵajinjilaga ucimwene ŵa ku Yuda, nipo ŵalamulile ku Yelusalemu yaka 11. Ŵelewo ŵalemwisye pameso pa AMBUJE,",
