        {
          "text": "Mwenye Nebukadinesa ŵa ku Babiloniya ŵayice kumenyana ni ŵandu ŵa mcilambo ca Yuda, ŵamkamwile Yehoiyakimu nipo ŵamjigele jwalakwejo kwawula najo ku Babiloniya ali amtaŵile ni ma unyolo.",
