          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pakutanda kwa caka, Mwenye Nebukadinesa ŵajigele Yehoiyakini kwawula nawo ku ukapolo ku Babiloniya, ŵajigele soni yida yamtengo wapenani ya m'Nyumba ja AMBUJE. Kaneko Nebukadinesa ŵamjigele Sedekiya mjombagwe, nipo ŵatesile ŵelewo kuŵa mwenye jwa ku Yuda ni ku Yelusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
